From 4ba28075881fb122dc60f7924c80ed1a9090e00d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Roman Kuraev <naoru.desu@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 19:56:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] linux-postmarketos-qcom-sm8250: follow USB-C limits in the
 PM8150B charger

Add kernel patches 0082-0087: the wake-IRQ, input-current and health fixes,
TCPM-following input limits with fresh USB-A detection, the charger's
link to the Type-C port and this board's 2 A battery current limit.
Advance to release 75.

Signed-off-by: Roman Kuraev <naoru.desu@gmail.com>
---
