 ...m8150b-add-the-charger-source-change.patch |  38 +
 ...nstantnoodlep-link-the-charger-to-th.patch |  40 ++
 .../linux-postmarketos-qcom-sm8250/APKBUILD   |  14 +-
 7 files changed, 844 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
